  "price_level": 1,
  "rating": 4,
  "reference": "ChIJqwTG-uphwokR_QqTc3u-m8M",
  "reservable": true,
  "reviews": [
    {
      "author_name": "S. B.",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101408013617262539484/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV72VepOg_6xO1-IMp395_za90pIVLI5brMQStKsbsUUe-Pkdpi=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
      "rating": 4,
      "relative_time_description": "a week ago",
      "text": "This is a Chinese congee/rice roll spot in Flushing, New York. The food comes out very quickly after you order, which is good if you’re looking for a quick and satisfying meal. Everything is served on paper plates, so if you can’t finish, it’s easy to take it to go. The congee has a light, comforting flavor, and the rice rolls and side dishes are tasty, street-food style snacks. Nice place for a casual and affordable bite.",
      "time": 1750036884,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Xin",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115499328070754850684/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXjMx0oceFkfDk2M_NiYYuKNzU8oJDZJKDh-mAWmGHwZx1uVfiq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
      "text": "This is my go-to rice roll and congee place Flushing. It's cheap and filling. The food is always good and consistent. This trip, we did not get congee because it was 90 degrees out. Instead, we shared curry fish ball, shrimp rice roll, beef and shrimp rice roll, char siu rice roll, and the special peanut sauce roll. Everything was delicious as always. We also got iced yuenyeung which is Hong Kong milk tea and coffee (not pictured).\n\nThe staff is adequate and functional. I don't need servers to sing my praises and validate my life choices or tell me their life's story. This place is cash only. It gets busy so it can be hard to get a table if you come with a larger party.",
      "time": 1750688640,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Sharon W",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114071915666227245859/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVOrUDeMKBXryxmsHjew1nUCX4sLFnxXmwR_yzy8W2M_x2WII4JvQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
      "text": "I tried Yin Ji a few times with take out to avoid any wait in line, and finally dine in there for a breakfast on Monday morning around 10am, plenty of seats. I had different types of Chang Fen including marinated beef, chive shrimp, fish filet. They were all really good, I like how fresh their ingredients are, including the crispy lettuce. Also had different type of congee, my favorite is the pork liver one, the liver was made very tender and flavored well. I had good dine in experience as well, the server gave us small cups to share our congee and our HK milk tea when we dine there with group of four. Overall, high quality of food, reasonably priced and good service.",
      "time": 1745804397,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Ray",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109180863225458282360/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUEYCjUZ6H5kT91AnTXkhD1FlBm1jRgnfWX7fq2LqluxXmqsIOM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
      "rating": 4,
      "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
      "text": "CASH ONLY.\nMy kids love Chang Fen from Dim Sum, so I took them here. The Chang Fen was very good, very smooth. We ordered four kinds, pork and shrimp mix, shrimps, beef, and wrapped around fried dough. My wife also got a Pidan Pork Congee, and that's very traditionally made, the best Congee we had for a while.\nSpace is limited, as there was a family with 8 adults and a lot of kids came in and took over half of the restaurant.",
      "time": 1748693949,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Hyekyung Kim",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102700899204009413941/reviews",
